            "value": "Hall KD, ve ark. (2011). “Quantification of the effect of energy imbalance on bodyweight.” Lancet 378(9793):826–837. Pound başına 3,500 kcal şeklindeki klasik kural, Wishnofsky M'nin (1958) Am J Clin Nutr 6:542–546 makalesine dayanır."
          }
        },
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
